    "Titles": {
        "eng": "Cat-Eyed Boy",
        "jpn": "妖怪伝・猫目小僧"
    },
    "Summaries": {
        "eng": "In the world of monsters, Nekomata, a cat-eyed boy, is born once every 300 years. However, because he was born resembling a human, his father angered the monsters and was killed, and the cat-eyed boy was abandoned by the monsters. The cat-eyed boy travels while hunting down monsters in search of his missing mother.",
        "jpn": "妖怪の世界では300年に一度の猫又の子供として生まれてきた猫目小僧。しかし、彼は人間に似た姿で生まれてきたために、父親は妖怪たちの怒りを買って殺されてしまい、猫目小僧は妖怪から見捨てられてしまう。猫目小僧は、まだ見ぬ母親を探して妖怪退治をしながら旅をする。"
    },
    "Aliases": [
        "Spirit Legend Cat-Eyed Boy"
    ],
    "Modified": "2026-01-29",
    "Seasons": {
